From: Dmitry Baryshkov <dmitry.baryshkov@oss.qualcomm.com>
Upstream-commit: 3906e5b1feea8cc3a817980c38a41b2151460d10
Upstream: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/43896

ir3: take the register file size from the device table

reg_size_vec4 is derived from the generation before a6xx, so a part whose
register file differs from the rest of its generation has no way to say so.

Move it into the device table, giving each pre-a6xx entry the value the
generation check produced: 96 for a3xx, 48 for a4xx and a5xx.  No functional
change.

